            <div class="white-box wb-3">超越语篇的学习<br>为主</div>

            <!-- Colored Blocks -->
            <div class="diag-block block-blue">
                话题<br>
                <span>What+How</span>
            </div>
            <div class="diag-block block-yellow">
                主题意义<br>
                <span>Why+How</span>
            </div>
            <div class="diag-block block-green">
                主题<br>
                <span>What+Why+How+So what (else)</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            (葛炳芳，2022：出版中)
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
